# "{T}: Untap another target permanent you control" (CR 701.26b, 115.1): the target is any other permanent of Bot1's. Turn 3: Mox Sapphire (an artifact), tapped
# for mana, is untapped by Patrol and taps for mana again ({U}{U} in all). Turn 5: Ornithopter (a creature) attacks and is untapped after combat. Patrol itself
# is refused as its own target (another), and so are Bot2's tapped Mox Jet and Bot2's own Memnite (you control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
North Pole Patrol
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Memnite
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.North Pole Patrol.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
! Bot1.Battlefield.North Pole Patrol.Activate(North Pole Patrol; Ability: Untap)
! Bot1.Battlefield.North Pole Patrol.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet; Ability: Untap)
! Bot1.Battlefield.North Pole Patrol.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite; Ability: Untap)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.North Pole Patrol.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire; Ability: Untap)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{U}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.North Pole Patrol.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Untap)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.North Pole Patrol.Tapped = true
